<div class="dim small"><%~ it.SPECIALISTSLength %> one-of-a-kind ships, each built for a single job. Each job drops that ship's <b>blueprints</b>, whatever you fly. Flying the specialist itself earns its unique resource, which the station refines into <b>parts</b> (<%~ it.PART_RATE %> to 1). Parts upgrade her five components, and a full set unlocks a timed <b>tier-up</b> in the drydock, up to Tier <%~ it.TIER_MAX %>.</div>